      "text": {
        "en": "Customers frequently praise the team for friendly, attentive assistance, noting that associates willingly load heavy feed sacks into trucks and offer pet treat samples. Long-time patrons appreciate the personal service across generations, though one shopper felt an associate was careless during an order pickup."
      }
    },
