      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Well-stocked farm inventory and supplies"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers value the broad selection of livestock feeds, pet foods, gardening goods, and local honey available in the store. However, some buyers report frustration with outdoor inventory storage during wet weather, and a customer experienced inventory errors when receiving untagged merchandise."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
