      "title": {
        "en": "Competitive bulk rates with price shifts"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple pet owners highlight affordable prices on large bags of dog food compared to big-box retailers. At the same time, some reviewers observe that certain items such as pine pellets have increased in cost over time, making them comparable to or higher than supermarket options."
      }
    }
